        .. "HIMIKO will want to\nhear what happened."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_HOOH_RETRY",
      "The rainbow light fades,\nbut the warm wind does\nnot.\f"
        .. "HO-OH may answer the\nshrine again."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_HOOH_CAUGHT_SHRINE",
      "The rooftop shrine is\nquiet.\f"
        .. "The RAINBOW WING rests\npeacefully in your BAG."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_HANAKO",
      "HANAKO: I'm HANAKO.\f"
        .. "My concern is a little\ndifferent from\nHIMIKO's.\f"
        .. "It concerns the sea\naround KANTO."
    )

    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
    -- "Guardian Below" dialogue.
    -- This is intentionally a functional first pass. Once both legendary
    -- branches are proven in-game, their shared history can be polished as
    -- one cohesive two-sided account.
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_START",
      "HANAKO: Grandmother kept\nmore than DAWN TOWER's\nrecords.\f"
        .. "She also collected\naccounts from KANTO's\nsouthern coast after\nthe great tsunami.\f"
        .. "Those sea journals\nwere the records she\nleft to me.\f"
        .. "She also left me this\nSILVER WING.\f"
        .. "Since we arrived in\nKANTO, it has felt\nstrangely warm.\f"
        .. "An old fisherman on\nROUTE 19 knew survivors\nof that disaster.\f"
        .. "Would you speak with\nhim for me?"
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_GOT_WING",
      "{PLAYER} received the\nSILVER WING!"
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_ROUTE19",
      "HANAKO: Start on ROUTE 19,\njust south of FUCHSIA.\f"
        .. "Look for the old\nfisherman near the shore."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_ROUTE20",
      "HANAKO: His story places\nthe turning point farther\nwest along ROUTE 20.\f"
        .. "There should still be\na memorial near\nSEAFOAM ISLANDS."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_SEAFOAM_REMINDER",
      "HANAKO: The SILVER WING\nis reacting to SEAFOAM.\f"
        .. "Search the lower caves\nfor anything older than\nour grandmother's notes."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_GONE_TO_SEAFOAM",
      "HANAKO is no longer here.\f"
        .. "She must have gone to\nSEAFOAM ISLANDS."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_RETURN_FIRST",
      "HANAKO: You caught it...\nLUGIA truly was there.\f"
        .. "Then Grandmother's sea\nrecords were describing\na real event.\f"
        .. "One part still troubles\nme: after the sea calmed,\nwitnesses heard bells\nand saw light inland.\f"
        .. "HIMIKO's records may\nhold the other half."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_RETURN_SECOND",
      "HANAKO: You caught LUGIA.\f"
        .. "Then the sea records and\nwhat you learned from\nHIMIKO really do belong\nto the same story.\f"
        .. "We should compare every\npage together."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_COMPLETE",
      "HANAKO: I keep rereading\nGrandmother's journals.\f"
        .. "KANTO's sea remembers\nmore than people do."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_FISHERMAN_IDLE",
      "OLD FISHERMAN: Water's\nquiet today.\f"
        .. "That's when you respect\nit most."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_FISHERMAN_STORY",
      "OLD FISHERMAN: The great\ntsunami? My father lived\nthrough it.\f"
        .. "He said the first wave\nwas terrible.\f"
        .. "Then an even larger wall\nof water rose offshore.\f"
        .. "Everyone thought KANTO\nwas finished.\f"
        .. "But the whole sea seemed\nto fold back on itself.\f"
        .. "Afterward, sailors swore\nthey saw something huge\nand white beneath the\nwater.\f"
        .. "The strangest currents\nwere west of here, near\nSEAFOAM ISLANDS."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_FISHERMAN_REPEAT",
      "OLD FISHERMAN: My father\nnever changed that story.\f"
        .. "The sea turned back near\nSEAFOAM."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_MEMORIAL_IDLE",
      "A weathered stone marks\nthe old SEAFOAM shore.\f"
        .. "Most of its inscription\nhas been worn smooth."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_MEMORIAL_DISCOVERY",
      "The SILVER WING grows\nwarm beside the stone.\f"
        .. "One surviving line can\nstill be read:\f"
        .. "\"HERE THE SECOND SEA\nTURNED FROM KANTO.\"\f"
        .. "The stone is much newer\nthan the cave behind it."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_MEMORIAL_REPEAT",
      "The memorial reads:\f"
        .. "\"HERE THE SECOND SEA\nTURNED FROM KANTO.\"\f"
        .. "The SILVER WING pulls\ntoward SEAFOAM."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_INSCRIPTION_IDLE",
      "A very old carving has\nbeen cut into the stone.\f"
        .. "Its meaning is unclear."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_INSCRIPTION_1",
      "The SILVER WING glints.\f"
        .. "The carving reads:\f"
        .. "\"WHEN THE DEEP ONE\nSTIRS, THE CURRENTS\nKNEEL.\""
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_INSCRIPTION_2",
      "Another carving becomes\nclear in the WING's light:\f"
        .. "\"SILVER BENEATH THE\nMOON. WINGS WITHOUT\nSKY.\""
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_INSCRIPTION_3",
      "The deepest carving is\nlonger than the others:\f"
        .. "\"WHEN THE GREAT WATER\nROSE, THE GUARDIAN\nROSE WITH IT.\f"
        .. "THE SEA BOWED... AND\nTURNED BACK.\""
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_INSCRIPTION_READ",
      "You've already copied\nthis carving."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_ALL_INSCRIPTIONS",
      "The three carvings fit\ntogether.\f"
        .. "HANAKO should see this.\f"
        .. "You sense someone deeper\nin SEAFOAM ISLANDS."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_SEAFOAM",
      "HANAKO: I compared the\ncarvings with Grandmother's\ncoastal journals.\f"
        .. "They describe the same\nday.\f"
        .. "The second wave never\nreached KANTO because\nsomething rose beneath it.\f"
        .. "The old people here\ncalled that guardian\nLUGIA.\f"
        .. "But Grandmother recorded\none detail they couldn't\nexplain:\f"
        .. "after the sea went still,\nbells were heard far away\nand light appeared over\ninland KANTO.\f"
        .. "...The SILVER WING is\nreacting again."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_WATCHING",
      "HANAKO: It's really here...\f"
        .. "I'll stay out of your way.\nGo on."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_ENCOUNTER_TEXT",
      "LUGIA watches silently\nfrom the old chamber."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_CAUGHT",
      "The violent pressure in\nthe cave fades away.\f"
        .. "The SILVER WING becomes\nstill."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_HANAKO_AFTER_CATCH",
      "HANAKO: So it was true...\f"
        .. "LUGIA really was the\nguardian beneath those\nwaves.\f"
        .. "Grandmother's journals\nweren't preserving some\nold sailor's legend.\f"
        .. "They were preserving a\nreal piece of KANTO's\nhistory.\f"
        .. "And after everything we\nfound down here... I don't\nthink we have the whole\nstory yet.\f"
        .. "I want to go back through\nher records while this is\nstill fresh in my mind.\f"
        .. "I'll be waiting for you\nback at CELADON GYM.\f"
        .. "Come find me when you're\nready."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_RETRY",
      "LUGIA retreats into the\nchamber, but does not\nleave.\f"
        .. "It can be challenged\nagain."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_LUGIA_ALREADY_CAUGHT",
      "The old chamber is quiet.\f"
        .. "Only the sound of water\nremains."
    )

    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
    -- Shared Ho-Oh / Lugia epilogue.
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_GUARDIANS_EPILOGUE",
      "ERIKA: HIMIKO... HANAKO...\f"
        .. "I think your records are\nconnected.\f"
        .. "HANAKO: Connected?\f"
        .. "ERIKA: Your sea journal\nsays the first wave hit\nDAWN TOWER.\f"
        .. "Then a second, larger\nwave rose near SEAFOAM\nISLANDS.\f"
        .. "HANAKO: That's when\nLUGIA appeared.\f"
        .. "The sea turned back.\f"
        .. "HIMIKO: Wait...\f"
        .. "My restoration logs say\nthe sea suddenly went\nstill that same morning!\f"
        .. "HANAKO: The same morning?\f"
        .. "HIMIKO: Yes.\f"
        .. "The first wave tore the\nBELL OF DAWN's striker\naway.\f"
        .. "At sunrise, the keepers\nrang MEMORY and RESOLVE.\f"
        .. "HANAKO: Grandmother's\nsea journal mentions\nbells from the coast!\f"
        .. "HIMIKO: And my record\nsays a rainbow crossed\nthe dawn sky just after.\f"
        .. "ERIKA: Then that's it.\f"
        .. "The sailors saw LUGIA\nat sea.\f"
        .. "The tower keepers saw\nHO-OH in the sky.\f"
        .. "HANAKO: Two views of the\nsame disaster...\f"
        .. "HIMIKO: And neither\nrecord had the whole\nstory.\f"
        .. "ERIKA: Over time, the\npieces were separated.\f"
        .. "HANAKO: LUGIA turned\naway the second wave.\f"
        .. "HIMIKO: And HO-OH\nanswered the surviving\nbells.\f"
        .. "ERIKA: {PLAYER}, you\nbrought both stories\nback together.\f"
        .. "HIMIKO: Grandmother\nwould have loved this.\f"
        .. "HANAKO: We finally\nunderstand.\f"
        .. "ERIKA: Then we'll make\nsure KANTO remembers it\nas one story."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_GUARDIANS_HIMIKO_AFTER",
      "HIMIKO: One story, seen\nfrom the tower and the\nsea.\f"
        .. "I wish Grandmother could\nhave heard us put it\ntogether."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_GUARDIANS_HANAKO_AFTER",
      "HANAKO: The records make\nsense now.\f"
        .. "Neither half was wrong.\nNeither half was enough."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_TRAIL_HIMIKO_WAIT",
      "HIMIKO: The tower's\nthree bells were built\nto answer one another.\f"
        .. "Start with the BELL OF\nMEMORY and keep\nclimbing."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_TRAIL_HIMIKO_STRIKER",
      "HIMIKO: The striker is\nmissing?\f"
        .. "Wait... Grandmother kept\ncopies of the tower's\nrestoration records.\f"
        .. "After the great tsunami,\ncrews recovered piles of\nunidentified debris.\f"
        .. "Years later, salvaged\nbronze was sent west to\nbe catalogued near\nINDIGO CITY.\f"
        .. "One wagon overturned\nwhile crossing the\nINDIGO HIGHLANDS.\f"
        .. "Several fittings were\nnever recovered.\f"
        .. "If the striker was in\nthat shipment, that's\nwhere I'd look."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_TRAIL_HIMIKO_STRIKER_REMINDER",
      "HIMIKO: A shipment of\nsalvaged tower bronze\nwas lost in the\nINDIGO HIGHLANDS.\f"
        .. "If the striker was in\nthat wagon, it may still\nbe among the rocks."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_TRAIL_HIMIKO_FOUND",
      "HIMIKO: That's it!\f"
        .. "The crest on that\nstriker matches the\nRAINBOW WING.\f"
        .. "Take it back to the\nBELL OF DAWN."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_TRAIL_HIMIKO_READY",
      "HIMIKO: All three bells\nhave answered.\f"
        .. "The RAINBOW WING is\nshining brilliantly.\f"
        .. "Go to the rooftop."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_BELL_DORMANT",
      "An enormous ancient\nbell hangs here.\f"
        .. "The metal is cold and\ncompletely silent."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_MEMORY_RING",
      "The RAINBOW WING gives\noff a faint warmth...\f"
        .. "You ring the\nBELL OF MEMORY.\f"
        .. "BOOOONG...\f"
        .. "The note echoes deep\nthrough the tower."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_MEMORY_DONE",
      "The BELL OF MEMORY is\nstill faintly humming."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_RESOLVE_LOCKED",
      "An inscription reads:\f"
        .. "MEMORY GIVES BIRTH\nTO RESOLVE."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_RESOLVE_RING",
      "The RAINBOW WING grows\nwarmer...\f"
        .. "You ring the\nBELL OF RESOLVE.\f"
        .. "BOOOONG...\f"
        .. "A second note answers\nthe first."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_RESOLVE_DONE",
      "The BELL OF RESOLVE\ncontinues to resonate."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_DAWN_LOCKED",
      "The final bell does not\nrespond.\f"
        .. "The first two echoes\nhave not both awakened."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_STRIKER_MISSING",
      "The BELL OF DAWN is\nintact...\f"
        .. "But the heavy bronze\nstriker that once struck\nthe bell is gone.\f"
        .. "The empty mounting is\nscarred and weathered.\f"
        .. "It looks like the striker\nhas been missing since\nthe tower was damaged.\f"
        .. "HIMIKO may know more\nabout the old repairs."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_STRIKER_REMINDER",
      "The BELL OF DAWN cannot\nbe rung without its\nmissing striker.\f"
        .. "HIMIKO may know what\nbecame of it."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_STRIKER_CLUE_REMINDER",
      "The BELL OF DAWN cannot\nbe rung without its\nmissing striker.\f"
        .. "HIMIKO's restoration\nrecords point toward the\nINDIGO HIGHLANDS."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_DAWN_RING",
      "You fit the SACRED\nSTRIKER back into its\nancient frame.\f"
        .. "The RAINBOW WING bursts\nwith brilliant light!\f"
        .. "You ring the\nBELL OF DAWN.\f"
        .. "BOOOONG...\f"
        .. "Three notes become one.\f"
        .. "Something powerful is\nwaiting above."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_DAWN_DONE",
      "The BELL OF DAWN rings\nsoftly in the wind."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_STRIKER_FOUND",
      "Wedged between the rocks\nis a heavy bronze\nstriker.\f"
        .. "A sun-shaped crest is\nengraved into its side.\f"
        .. "You recovered the\nSACRED STRIKER!"
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_HOOH_WAIT",
      "A warm wind circles the\nrooftop shrine..."
    )

    -- each Dawn Keeper now has distinct dialogue tied to their floor
    -- and to the tower's Memory -> Resolve -> Dawn progression.
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_1F_1_BATTLE",
      "You stand in a place\nolder than KANTO's\nLeague.\f"
        .. "Climb only if you\nrespect what sleeps\nabove."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_1F_1_WON",
      "You did not come here\nlightly."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_1F_1_AFTER",
      "Long before the tower\nwas damaged, pilgrims\ncame here at sunrise.\f"
        .. "Few remembered why."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_1F_2_BATTLE",
      "The sea broke these\nwalls once.\f"
        .. "It did not break the\nkeepers who remained."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_1F_2_WON",
      "Perhaps you would have\nremained too."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_1F_2_AFTER",
      "We rebuilt what we\ncould after the great\ntsunami.\f"
        .. "Some things were lost\nfar from the tower."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_2F_1_BATTLE",
      "Memory is more than\nlooking backward.\f"
        .. "Show me what your\njourney has taught you!"
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_2F_1_WON",
      "Your past has made you\nstrong."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_2F_1_AFTER",
      "The BELL OF MEMORY does\nnot reveal the past.\f"
        .. "It asks whether you\ncarry it with you."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_2F_2_BATTLE",
      "Every scar in this\ntower has a story.\f"
        .. "Let's see what story\nyou leave behind!"
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_2F_2_WON",
      "That is a story worth\nremembering."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_2F_2_AFTER",
      "Our oldest records speak\nof a rainbow crossing\nthe dawn sky.\f"
        .. "Then the great bird\nvanished."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_3F_1_BATTLE",
      "Resolve is easy when\nthe road is clear.\f"
        .. "What happens when it\nisn't?"
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_3F_1_WON",
      "You found your way\nthrough."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_3F_1_AFTER",
      "The BELL OF RESOLVE was\nrung before dangerous\njourneys.\f"
        .. "Not for luck. For the\ncourage to continue."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_3F_2_BATTLE",
      "Storms, fire, the sea...\nThe tower endured them\nall.\f"
        .. "Can you say the same?"
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_3F_2_WON",
      "Yes. I believe you can."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_3F_2_AFTER",
      "The keepers once guarded\nmore than these bells.\f"
        .. "We guarded a promise\nbetween KANTO and the\nsun."
    )

    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_4F_1_BATTLE",
      "Memory behind you.\nResolve within you.\f"
        .. "Only dawn remains.\f"
        .. "Prove you deserve to\nsee it!"
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_4F_1_WON",
      "Then go. The summit is\nyours to face."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_4F_1_AFTER",
      "If the three bells answer\none another, do not be\nafraid of what follows.\f"
        .. "Some legends return\nonly when called."
    )

    -- Fallback text for any future Dawn Keeper that has not been given a
    -- unique dialogue set yet.
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_BATTLE",
      "The bells test everyone\nwho climbs this tower.\f"
        .. "Show me your resolve!"
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_WON",
      "The tower accepts your\nstrength."
    )
    mod.content.text:register(
      "_MARS_DAWN_KEEPER_AFTER",
      "This tower has endured\nfire, storms, and the\nsea.\f"
        .. "Still, its bells\nremember."
    )

