  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  -- ALABASTER TOWN / ROUTE 26 — "FROZEN FOOTPRINTS"
  --
  -- Unlock: possess the SILPH SCOPE.
  --
  -- Flow:
  --   1. The old man in ALABASTER HOUSE 1 recounts the old FROSLASS legend
  --      and asks the player to investigate a newly missing child.
  --   2. Six clue objects are spread across Route 26, Alabaster Town and
  --      Alabaster Cave (two in each area).
  --   3. Return all six clues to the old man. He fears the old legend has
  --      repeated itself and runs to Alabaster Cave.
  --   4. On entering the cave, he calls FROSLASS out and attacks first.
  --      FROSLASS overwhelms him, then fights the player in an uncatchable
  --      trainer-style Lv32 battle and retreats deeper when defeated.
  --   5. A deeper section of 1F reveals the missing girl unharmed with two
  --      SNORUNT. FROSLASS brought her there to play with its young and only
  --      retaliated when attacked.
  --   6. Back at the house, the old man admits he judged this FROSLASS for
  --      old crimes it never committed and rewards the player with the
  --      game's existing ICE BEAM TM.
  --
  -- EVENT_FROSLASS_QUEST_COMPLETE replaces the old Route 3 Togepi gift in
  -- Arceus's capstone prerequisite list.
